---
// REDESIGN PROTOTYPE - "SERP" - Concept 47.
// A modern search engine results page where Swapnil ranks #1 for his own positioning, led by an
// AI Overview. Original concept (NOT a reskin): its own light search-UI palette, system-sans type,
// two-column results + knowledge-panel layout, and a signature AEO mechanic (the AI Overview
// generates in with a shimmer then streams text carrying inline citations).
//  - The whole page IS a SERP: logo + search bar with the query typed, result tabs, a results
//    count/time line, an AI OVERVIEW card, a FEATURED SNIPPET, six ORGANIC RESULTS (green
//    breadcrumb URL, blue title, meta-description, rich-snippet chips), a right-rail KNOWLEDGE
//    PANEL (about + profile links + contact actions), a PEOPLE ALSO ASK accordion, and a footer
//    "Searches related to" chip row + sitelinks. Contact lives in the knowledge-panel actions.
//  - Light, clean search chrome: bg #f6f8fc, white cards, link blue #1a56db, result-URL green
//    #0b7a3b, AI-overview violet #7c3aed on a soft tinted card. Ink #1f2430, muted #5f6570.
// Self-contained: own <html>, own Google Fonts <link>, own CSS tokens, noindex. No BaseLayout.
// SAFETY-NET / GOTCHA NOTES: the AI Overview paragraph, its citations and source chips ALL live in
// the markup and are fully visible with JS off. JS only (a) shows a shimmer skeleton then streams
// the text in, and (b) toggles the PAA accordion. Every JS reveal triggers immediately for in-view
// content AND a setTimeout (~2.6s) force-finalizes the overview to its full visible state.
// prefers-reduced-motion shows the overview fully rendered with no shimmer/stream. No text-shadow
// or filter is placed on any background-clip:text element.
